    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Native WordPress plugin that integrates Typed.js as a custom Elementor widget.</p>\n<h3>Plugin Dependencies</h3>\n<p>This plugin requires Elementor.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Copy the <code>typed-elementor-widget/</code> folder into <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from the WordPress Plugins panel</li>\n<li>Open Elementor and search for the widget &#8220;Typed.js Animator&#8221; in the left sidebar</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20plugin%20require%20elementor%3F\">\nDoes this plugin require Elementor?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Elementor Free or Pro 3.5+ is required.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved Elementor editor preview and initialization.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
